---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer id="contact" class="py-16 border-t border-border/40 mt-20 relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-glow rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 mb-12 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/5 via-indigo-500/5 to-purple-500/5 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest">¿Hablamos de tu proyecto?</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-foreground mt-3 mb-4">
        Construyamos algo <span class="gradient-text-cyan">extraordinario</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Estoy disponible para desarrollos web integrales, soluciones asistidas por Inteligencia Artificial y consultoría técnica.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="mailto:ramonmenor@gmail.com"
          class="px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-indigo-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-sm shadow-xl shadow-cyan-500/20 hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          ✉️ ramonmenor@gmail.com
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/ramonmenor"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-border/60 text-foreground font-mono text-xs hover:bg-white/10 transition-all"
        >
          LinkedIn: /in/ramonmenor
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/ramonmenor"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-border/60 text-foreground font-mono text-xs hover:bg-white/10 transition-all"
        >
          GitHub: @ramonmenor
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground gap-4">
      <div>
        &copy; {today.getFullYear()} Ramón Menor — Full Stack & AI Developer
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>ramonmenor.es</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
